    <string name="data_storage">Data a wɔkora so</string>
    <string name="data_storage_intro">Retro Player de app nhyehyeɛ sie wɔ mpɔtam hɔ database ketewa bi mu. Wo nnwom ne nnwom a woabɔ no tra hɔ sɛ fael a ɛyɛ daa wɔ folda ahorow a wopaw mu.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_title">App database</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_body">Fael: %1$s .\nƆkwan: %2$s .\n\nSie nhomakorabea ntini, browse tebea, playback resume, equalizer, asɛmti, ne kasa a wopɛ.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_title">Nnwom fael ahorow</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_body">Wɔnnyɛ ɔdio fael ahorow no kɔpi nhyɛ app database no mu da. Fa nhomakorabea folda ahorow ka ho na Retro Player kenkan fael ahorow fi disk so tẽẽ.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_title">Playlist fael ahorow</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_body">Playlists yɛ .m3u fael a ɛnyɛ den a wɔde asie wo nhomakorabea folda ahorow mu. Wubetumi asiesie wɔn wɔ app no mu anaasɛ wode text editor biara asiesie.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_title">Asɛnka agua: %1$s</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_permissions_title">Android tumi krataa ne nneɛma a wɔkora so</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_native_body">Retro Player sie ne database wɔ app-private support area wɔ emu storage so. Wo nnwom fael ahorow no tra folda ahorow a wode system folder picker no paw no mu.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_title">Android akyi a wɔbɔ</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_body">Sɛ ɔdio rebɔ a, Retro Player yɛ foreground media service enti sɛ woto fon no mu anaa wosesa apps a, na transport controls wɔ system notification no mu a, playback kɔ so. Sɛ wotwe app no fi Recents so a, ɛma wogyae bɔ na woyi amanneɛbɔ no fi hɔ.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_body_android">Wɔde app data sie wɔ app-private support area wɔ internal storage so.</string>
